{"strongs": "H1137", "word": "בָּנִי", "translit": "ba.ni", "root": "בלס", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine 1.", "gloss": "one of David's heroes", "definition": "בָּנִי proper name, masculine 1. one of David's heroes 2Sam 23:36 בָּנִי הַגָּדִי (|| 1Chr 11:38 has בֶּןהַֿגְרִי , but see Dr Sm ). 2. Levites, \\ \\ a. 1Chr 6:31 \\ \\ b. Neh 3:17 compare Neh 8:7 (= בִּנּוּי Neh 10:10 ) Neh 9:4 (twice in verse) (repeated probably by error, compare BeRy ) v Neh 9:5 ; Neh 10:14 ; Neh 11:22 . On Ezra 2:40 = Neh 7:43 compare Gr Geschichte.ii.2,389 ; he reads קדמיאל בני for קדמיאל לבני , taking בני as proper name, as 3 Ezra 5:26 Καδμιηλου καὶ Βαννου . 3. a man of Judah 1Chr 9:4 ( מִן ) בָּנִי Qr ( > Kt בנימן ). 4. Ezra 2:10 read בִּנּוּי compare || Neh 7:15 . 5. heads of families of Isr. \\ \\ a. Ezra 10:29 \\ \\ b. Neh 10:15 \\ \\ c. Ezra 10:34 but perhaps read בִּנּוּי or בִּגְּוַי compare above 6. an Israelite Ezra 10:38 . — ( בני as proper name Palmyrene Vog No. 94 .)", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1186')\">BDB1186</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1137')\">H1137</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1185')\">BDB1185</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1187')\">BDB1187</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בָּנִי</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>proper name, masculine 1.</b> <highlightword>one of David's heroes</highlightword> <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:36\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,36)\">2Sam 23:36</ref> <bdbheb>בָּנִי הַגָּדִי</bdbheb> (|| <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:38\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,38)\">1Chr 11:38</ref> has <bdbheb>בֶּןהַֿגְרִי</bdbheb>, but see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Sm</sup></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> Levites, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,31)\">1Chr 6:31</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 3:17\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(16,3,17)\">Neh 3:17</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Neh 8:7\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,7)\">Neh 8:7</ref> (= <bdbheb>בִּנּוּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,10)\">Neh 10:10</ref>) <ref ref=\"Neh 9:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,4)\">Neh 9:4</ref> (twice in verse) (repeated probably by error, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">BeRy</lookup>) v<ref ref=\"Neh 9:5\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,5)\">Neh 9:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,14)\">Neh 10:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 11:22\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(16,11,22)\">Neh 11:22</ref>. On <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,40)\">Ezra 2:40</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:43\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,43)\">Neh 7:43</ref> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr<sup>Geschichte.ii.2,389</sup></lookup>; he reads <bdbheb>קדמיאל בני</bdbheb> for <bdbheb>קדמיאל לבני</bdbheb>, taking <bdbheb>בני</bdbheb> as proper name, as 3 <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Ezra 5:26\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(15,5,26)\">Ezra 5:26</ref> <grk>Καδμιηλου καὶ Βαννου</grk>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> a man of Judah <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:4\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,4)\">1Chr 9:4</ref> (<bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>בָּנִי</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> ( &gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>בנימן</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:10\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,10)\">Ezra 2:10</ref> read <bdbheb>בִּנּוּי</bdbheb> compare || <ref ref=\"Neh 7:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,15)\">Neh 7:15</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> heads of families of Isr. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:29\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,29)\">Ezra 10:29</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> <ref ref=\"Neh 10:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,15)\">Neh 10:15</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:34\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,34)\">Ezra 10:34</ref> but perhaps read <bdbheb>בִּנּוּי</bdbheb> or <bdbheb>בִּגְּוַי</bdbheb> compare above </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> an Israelite <ref ref=\"Ezra 10:38\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(15,10,38)\">Ezra 10:38</ref>. — (<bdbheb>בני</bdbheb> as proper name Palmyrene <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vog')\">Vog<sup>No. 94</sup></lookup>.) </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 23:36", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 23, "verse": 36}, {"raw": "1Chr 11:38", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:31", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Neh 3:17", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 3, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Neh 8:7", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Neh 10:10", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 10, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Neh 9:4", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Neh 9:5", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 9, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Neh 10:14", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 10, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Neh 11:22", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezra 2:40", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 2, "verse": 